<title>BELGIUM: EU sets monthly non-annex II sugar refunds.</title>
<headline>EU sets monthly non-annex II sugar refunds.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's sugar management committee has set the monthly non-annex II sugar refunds, an EU member state official said.</p>
<p>The official gave the rates on Thursday, in Ecus per 100 kg, as follows-</p>
<p>  whites    41.160</p>
<p>  raws in natural state 37.87 -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
